  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f400%252fPortal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w0b04gw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"619\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>该模组重新创建了来自Valve游戏的热门游戏中的传送枪。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>物品：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>末影珍珠粉尘</h4>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HIqk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h4>迷你黑洞</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/okEMp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h4>默认传送枪（普通模式）</h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Aa7A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"136\"></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>按攻击键发射蓝色传送门，使用物品键发射橙色传送门。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>已过期：</strong></p>\n<p>有关1.10.2和1.12.2版本发布细节的公告可以在这里找到：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fportal-gun-is-back-heres-whats-new-and-whats-to-come%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a>。</p>\n<p>旧版本的模组发布页面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fichun.me%252fmods%252fportalgun%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a>。</p>",
